        "bullet_point_content_1": "<p>Systems fall behind, afternoons flatten, and recoveries lengthen. Most supplements work on the surface. Spike. Fade. Reset. </p>",
        "bullet_point_image_1": "shopify://shop_images/pills-trimed.png",
