    "custom_muto_insides_ReWFNz": {
      "type": "custom-muto-insides",
      "blocks": {
        "item_drbzRY": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "NR (Nicotinamide Riboside)",
            "sub_title": "The core ingredient.",
            "content": "<p>NR is the ingredient your body converts directly into NAD⁺, the fuel every cell runs on - and since NAD⁺ levels are roughly halved by 40, NR is the most direct way to start restoring what's been lost.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_9bLpAc": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "CoQ10",
            "sub_title": "The engine support.",
            "content": "<p>Think of the mitochondria as the tiny engine inside every cell - CoQ10 is the spark plug that helps it actually turn fuel into usable energy, rather than just sitting there unused.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_VaxhWc": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Pterostilbene",
            "sub_title": "The amplifier.",
            "content": "<p>Pterostilbene works alongside NR to raise NAD⁺ further than either ingredient manages alone - which is exactly why a single-ingredient NAD⁺ supplement leaves real performance on the table.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_zeMV8W": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Quercetin",
            "sub_title": "The clean-up crew.",
            "content": "<p>Over time, the body accumulates damaged cells that just sit there taking up space. Quercetin helps clear them out, which keeps the cellular environment clean enough for the rest of the formula to actually do its job.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_jNganj": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Bioperine®",
            "sub_title": "The delivery driver.",
            "content": "<p>Without BioPerine, a meaningful share of what you're taking never makes it past the stomach. It's a small ingredient with an outsized job - it makes everything else in the formula more effective, and there's no real substitute for it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_B7VpRY": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Methylated B Complex + D3 + K2",
            "sub_title": "The foundation.",
            "content": "<p>Energy production, cellular communication, immune function - these are the basics, and they're also where most people are quietly running short. Without them in place, the rest of the formula has nothing solid to build on.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_7eynDw": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Turmeric Extract",
            "sub_title": "The inflammation defence.",
            "content": "<p>Inflammation is a normal response to effort - the problem is when it doesn't fully resolve afterwards. Turmeric supports that daily repair process, helping the body actually come back from effort rather than carrying it forward.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_e99hKM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Grape Seed Extract",
            "sub_title": "The circulation layer.",
            "content": "<p>None of this works if it never reaches the cell - Grape Seed Extract supports healthy blood flow, which is simply how the rest of the formula gets to where it needs to go.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_NUgehb": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Zinc & Copper",
            "sub_title": "The repair minerals.",
            "content": "<p>Zinc plays a direct role in cellular repair and immune function, and it's one of the minerals most commonly depleted in people who train regularly. Copper works alongside it - supporting energy production and keeping zinc properly balanced, rather than left to run unchecked on its own.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
